Description: VantaOS Gamer profile metapackage
 Gaming and creator defaults for VantaOS, including launchers, overlays, Wine,
 GPU tools, OpenRGB, and OBS Studio. Discord and VSCodium are delivered by
 Flatpak in the profile manifest.
